# Commands that 'permission apply' must not pre-approve.
# generate and retro call external model APIs and write operational state or
# mutable editorial guidance; init and feedback mutate the store; collect,
# show, list and doctor stay pre-approved.
daybrief init
daybrief generate
daybrief feedback
daybrief retro
# mcp serves briefings to other agents and records their feedback.
daybrief mcp
# The server is an implementation detail of 'daybrief mcp', run only by it.
daybrief-mcp
